    "text": "boothbayregister.com\nwebsite\nBrunswick\nWhat's the Buzz? A Guest Review. Tootsie’ a Fresh Remake\nBy Eleanor Cade Busby,\n10 hours agoDan DeLuca brings down the house as Dorothy Michaels in Maine Coast Music Theatre's production of 'Tootsie.'. Tootsie -a Fresh Remake Now at Maine State Music Theatre. \"Tootsie: is on the boards right now at Maine State Music Theatre on the Bowdoin Campus in Brunswick and it’s not a ho-hum remake of a film made-into-a-musical, that seems to be the popular trend on regional stages. This script and production is familiar, yet fresh!",
